                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-left-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>第一章&nbsp;&nbsp;绪 &nbsp;&nbsp;论（王美青）</p>
<table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc;  border: 1px solid #000000;" border="1">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="226">
<p><strong>主要内容</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="145">
<p><strong>学习目标</strong></p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="201">
<p><strong>教学方法与手段</strong></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="226">
<p>一、《口腔解剖生理学》的诞生与发展</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" rowspan="6" width="145">
<p>1.知识目标：阐述口腔解剖生理学》的定义；</p>
<p>2.能力目标：列举《口腔解剖生理学》的定义。</p>
<p>3.价值目标：建立口腔医学全科概念，树立多学科联合治疗的理念</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" rowspan="6" width="201">
<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;本章节主要回顾发展史及主要研究成果，主要通过讲授法进行，通过大量的研究图片加深学生对相关内容的认识。</p>
<p><strong>主要教学方法：</strong>讲授法、信息化教学。</p>
<p><strong>主要教学手段：</strong>电子幻灯、图片。</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="226">
<p>二、《口腔解剖生理学》研究的内容</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="226">
<p>（一）基础研究</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="226">
